  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Stablization Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Community Stabilization Activity (CSA) Program provides technical assistance to the Government of Colombia (GoC) within the framework of the institutional response to mixed migration inflows of Venezuelans and Colombian returnees into the country. This panorama evidences the high number of migrants from Venezuela and returnees who wish to settle in Colombia, situation which has a direct impact on economic and social development processes.</narrative>
  </description>
